CI working directory guidance

To avoid "Could not determine project root directory for Flutter project":

- Determine and cd to Flutter project root before running Flutter commands:
  bash student-attendance-tracker-216606-216615/print_flutter_project_root.sh

- Or use the new helper which echoes the absolute path:
  FLUTTER_DIR="$(bash student-attendance-tracker-216606-216615/ensure_flutter_root.sh)"
  cd "$FLUTTER_DIR"
  flutter pub get
  flutter analyze
  CI=true flutter test -r expanded

Flutter project root:
student-attendance-tracker-216606-216615/attendance_tracker_frontend
